2. NVIDIA libdevice (CUDA Toolkit 13.2, NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit End User License Agreement)

   Covers: volkit/ptx/volkit.sm80.ptx and volkit/ptx/volkit.sm120.ptx, and the cubins scripts/build-cubin.sh
   compiles from them (volkit/ptx/volkit.sm80.*.cubin and volkit/ptx/volkit.sm120.*.cubin).
   scripts/build-ptx.sh links libdevice.10.bc (its SHA-256 is in volkit/ptx/tools.txt) into the kernels of
   both, so the PTX and cubins contain compiled code from libdevice's __nv_expf, __nv_sqrtf, __nv_fmaxf,
   __nv_fminf and __nv_rintf.
   libdevice is listed as distributable in Attachment A of the CUDA EULA, and that code is
   distributed under the EULA's terms, not under volkit's licence. The EULA is at
   https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/eula/ and in each CUDA Toolkit as EULA.txt.

